tes dangling stored files[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]retention[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]retention: let the trash store accept a missing payload on opt-in, pass [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the flag from the retention pass, and keep purge running so one bad row [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]never wedges the hourly job.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Grace window for unresolved deferred prompt archives[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pubnoise[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pubnoise: treat a young unresolved prompt archive as a deferral (no [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]error, no attempt charge) and only escalate to digest errors past a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]grace window.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1t0","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1t0.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-1t0.1"},"source_run_id":"run-6786ece11c4b3296b03de2fb429cc9eb","started_at":"2026-11-15T17:31:54.068581+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"3a7e6ff55334b3c51459b137c6957e70a4864c9626a9d20f95f6db19e1656d16","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1t0.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"a015fa4318cc481003ebe7fe3ece2773dfd4327e75abe3525229b009cad8935d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1t0.land/meta.json","size_bytes":648},"prompt":{"digest":"e3542869acfd13bbd7a89fbc5850da8277ad5bfc0376bf458e7351f8960be226","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1t0.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":186},"state":{"digest":"2662fc87a2807622d3300e509ad17ae2fb1090d